# Build context for the Codvian Router image. Keep the context small and
# make sure no secrets, local state, or VCS metadata ever lands in the image.

.git
.github
docs

# Docs are not needed at runtime; README.md is the one exception because
# GoReleaser archives it with releases (harmless in the Docker context too).
*.md
!README.md

# Packaging/install scripts are for the host, not the image.
scripts

# Local state: ledger/vault data, sqlite files, editor and tool caches.
data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.idea/
.vscode/
coverage.out
coverage.html

# npm wrapper download cache (bin/.cache/) and node modules.
node_modules/
bin/.cache/

# Go test files are not needed to build the binary.
**/*_test.go
